WEBVTT

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.720
Ilikua joto,

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.816
moja ya zile siku za Kusini

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.560
ambapo ungeweza kuhisi
lami kabisa --

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:47.000
mvuko ukipenya nje ya lami.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.200
Na kundi la karibia watu 14,

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.440
likamchagua Jonathan Daniels,

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.536
Padre Morrisroe, ambae alikuja
kwenye jimbo hivi karibuni,